{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"better\":\"Y\",\"regress\":\"有，Y在S05（仅18秒）信息偏密，连续多行叙述加感受词容易让人来不及消化；个别感受意象也略显堆叠。\",\"nets\":{\"scan\":\"Y\",\"point\":\"Y\",\"why\":\"Y\",\"whole\":\"Y\",\"fine\":\"Y\"},\"why\":\"Y用加亮短语建立了很清楚的视觉重点，即使边听边扫，也容易抓住每段发生了什么、人物在担心什么以及为什么改变想法。感受词按音乐进程出现，比X右侧同时摆放大量短词更容易形成听觉与情绪的对应，而且船、水、摇荡、停泊等意象逐渐形成呼应，让前后更像一段完整经历。整体而言，Y不仅传达了故事，也让观众更容易感受到人物心理变化的细微层次。\"} </escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "26f92dc1-8e09-4e78-ae89-2a2c14dd8cd8", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T194754998478Z", "elapsed_seconds": 133.282, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:50:08.295168+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "c0531fbb7d67c139458f7fce874fc8a45f30e25ab6d1fcbd362785392ac351fa", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee53